<HEAD>PART 4065&#x2014;ANNUAL REPORT
</HEAD>
<AUTH>
<HED>Authority:</HED><PSPACE>29 U.S.C. 1302(b)(3), 1365.
</PSPACE></AUTH>
<SOURCE>
<HED>Source:</HED><PSPACE>61 FR 34082, July 1, 1996, unless otherwise noted.
</PSPACE></SOURCE>
<DIV8 N="4065.1" TYPE="SECTION" hierarchy_metadata="{&quot;path&quot;:&quot;/on/_SUBSTITUTE_DATE_/title-29/section-4065.1&quot;,&quot;citation&quot;:&quot;29 CFR 4065.1&quot;}">
<HEAD>&#xA7; 4065.1 Purpose and scope.</HEAD>
<P>The purpose of this part is to specify the form and content of the Annual Report required by section 4065 of ERISA. This part applies to all plans covered by title IV of ERISA.</P>
</DIV8>

<DIV8 N="4065.2" TYPE="SECTION" hierarchy_metadata="{&quot;path&quot;:&quot;/on/_SUBSTITUTE_DATE_/title-29/section-4065.2&quot;,&quot;citation&quot;:&quot;29 CFR 4065.2&quot;}">
<HEAD>&#xA7; 4065.2 Definitions.</HEAD>
<P>The following terms are defined in &#xA7; 4001.2 of this chapter: ERISA, IRS, PBGC, and plan.</P>
</DIV8>

<DIV8 N="4065.3" TYPE="SECTION" hierarchy_metadata="{&quot;path&quot;:&quot;/on/_SUBSTITUTE_DATE_/title-29/section-4065.3&quot;,&quot;citation&quot;:&quot;29 CFR 4065.3&quot;}">
<HEAD>&#xA7; 4065.3 Filing requirement.</HEAD>
<P>(a) The requirement to report the occurrence of a reportable event under section 4043 of ERISA in the Annual Report is waived.</P>
<P>(b) Plan administrators shall file the Annual Report on IRS/DOL/PBGC Form 5500, 5500-C, 5500-K or 5500-R, as appropriate, in accordance with the instructions therein.</P>
<CITA TYPE="N">[61 FR 34082, July 1, 1996, as amended at 61 FR 63998, Dec. 2, 1996; 90 FR 39328, Aug. 15, 2025]
</CITA>
</DIV8>

